  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Flowers sprout from the ground at your feet, filling the air with pollen that carries rejuvenating energy to your allies.</p><p>You and each creature of your choice within a <strong>5-space-radius</strong> of you heals <strong>1 Stamina</strong> at the start of its turn.</p><p>Each extra success increases the <strong>Stamina</strong> healed by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may extend the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong> per extra success.</p><p>This spell only affects living, physical creatures that need to breathe.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.klgWs6iuOjAfnQYM]{Lifebloom}</p>",
